  },
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why does this happen?",
      "char_file": "냉음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Certain foods and drinking",
        "habits build up gas",
        "",
        "in your stomach and gut,",
        "and that's what causes the bloat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Protein Bars & Shakes",
      "char_file": "프로틴바_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Sugar alcohols barely",
        "get absorbed by your gut",
        "",
        "so bacteria ferment them",
        "in your colon and make gas"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Try This Instead",
      "char_file": "프로틴바_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Pick bars sweetened with",
        "monk fruit or stevia",
        "",
        "and check the label",
        "for sugar alcohol grams"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Raw Cruciferous Veggies",
      "char_file": "케일_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Raw broccoli, kale, and cabbage",
        "are loaded with raffinose",
        "",
        "a sugar bacteria ferment",
        "in your colon, creating gas"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Try This Instead",
      "char_file": "케일_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Steam them instead",
        "of eating them raw",
        "",
        "your body breaks them down",
        "much easier when cooked"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Drinking Through a Straw",
      "char_file": "냉음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Every sip through a straw",
        "pulls extra air in",
        "",
        "doctors call this habit",
        "aerophagia"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Try This Instead",
      "char_file": "냉음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Drink straight from",
        "the cup instead",
        "",
        "and keep that",
        "extra air out"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "You don't have to",
